        "title": "16.1 HUMAN SKELETON",
        "headingUrdu": "انسانی کنڈکا",
        "headingPashto": "انسانی ډویلپا",
        "urduTitle": "انسانی کنڈکا",
        "text": "The vertebrate skeleton is composed either of cartilage or bone. Both tissues provide an internal supporting framework of the body. Human adults have bony skeleton, but cartilage is also present in some regions.",
