        "heading": "16.3 MUSCLES",
        "title": "16.3 MUSCLES",
        "headingUrdu": "عضلے",
        "headingPashto": "عضلونه",
        "urduTitle": "عضلے",
        "text": "Muscle is a specialized tissue of mesodermal origin. Muscle tissue makes up nearly half the human body mass. The most distinguishing functional characteristic of muscles is their ability to transform chemical energy (ATP) into mechanical energy. In doing so, they become capable of exerting force.",
        "paras": [
          "Muscle is a specialized tissue of mesodermal origin. Muscle tissue makes up nearly half the human body mass. The most distinguishing functional characteristic of muscles is their ability to transform chemical energy (ATP) into mechanical energy. In doing so, they become capable of exerting force."
        ],
