          "the form of simple reflexes such as removing one's hand from a hot stove and the withdrawal of an acid - stimulated leg by a fresh brainless frog. Not all unlearned behaviours are in the form of simple reflexes many complicated activities in man are also innate. The human suckling reflex is a good example of a complex unlearned behaviour.",
