        "text": "When the body is exposed to the weak or dead organisms (vaccine), the body is triggered to produce antibodies. Since the injected agents are weak or dead, the body does not actually suffer the disease, but an immune response is initiated. Now the body is fully equipped to fight against the actual causative agent like virus or bacteria that attack the body later in life. The same principle works in the body in case of natural active immunity. That is the reason why some childhood diseases occur only once in the lifetime.",
